{"channelId":"UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","row":["Apex Massage Therapy",25,"Award winning massage clinic. Registered massage therapists offering the best massage in Calgary with a focus on creating a client centric experience -CCA Award\n\n**Chasing pain is no way to heal your body.**\n\nBut when you wake up with that nagging neck…\nthat headache that just won’t quit…\nor the stiffness from yesterday’s workout…\n\n**we’re here to help.**\n\nFor more than a decade, we’ve intentionally set aside an appointment or two in our schedule each day for the people who need a little help **today**.\n\nBecause sometimes you don’t want to wait three days for an appointment.\nYou don’t want to push through the pain.\nAnd you shouldn’t have to.\n\nCall us before **10 AM, Monday–Thursday**, and we’ll do our best to get you in for a same-day treatment.\n\nYour body is talking.\nLet’s listen to it.\n\n📍 Calgary\n💆‍♀️ Registered Massage Therapy, TCM Acupuncture and Manual Osteopath\n📅 Same-day appointments when available","","Canada"],"channelUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","biographySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:23.468Z","channelId":"UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","sourceType":"about","contentHash":"eacd9257d241e6cab1be7f24cdd43091fafcec95c89165bf5689b76fd1a77cf5","complete":true,"readStatus":"read","captureSha256":"4f6427730e3890e22512dcd7b263924e57b24c752f5ae3c6c239feaefc5c2f61"},"countrySource":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:23.468Z"},"followerAccounts":[{"platform":"youtube","url":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","identityStatus":"channel_published","value":25,"raw":"25 subscribers","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCCHaGm7HbHImb9Y0xdvjqqQ","observedAt":"2026-09-18T12:07:23.468Z"}],"emails":[],"contactPages":[],"matchedKeywords":["massage therapist